{"id":"f23e822ba5d24954","group":"91","path":"91/91-fact-truth-theory-overview.md","title":"fact-truth-theory-overview — 五种标准系统的机制记录","display":"fact-truth-theory-overview — 五种标准系统的机制记录","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-fact-truth-theory-overview","aliases":["91-fact-truth-theory-overview","91-fact-overview","91-fact-truth-overview"],"display":"fact-truth-theory-overview — 五种标准系统的机制记录","depends_on":["[[91-df-TB]]","[[91-df-UTB]]","[[91-df-KF]]","[[91-df-FS]]","[[91-df-VF]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-fact-truth-theory-overview"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-fact-truth-theory-overview</span><span>91-fact-overview</span><span>91-fact-truth-overview</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-truth-theory-overview — 五种标准系统的机制记录"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6018cc1b13710826\" href=\"?note=6018cc1b13710826\" title=\"91-df-TB\">91-df-TB</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2f215d3f10d33ae6\" href=\"?note=2f215d3f10d33ae6\" title=\"91-df-UTB\">91-df-UTB</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a0a2284f96eaea1d\" href=\"?note=a0a2284f96eaea1d\" title=\"91-df-KF\">91-df-KF</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25c37fe51095276d\" href=\"?note=25c37fe51095276d\" title=\"91-df-FS\">91-df-FS</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"669ee474b9646a38\" href=\"?note=669ee474b9646a38\" title=\"91-df-VF\">91-df-VF</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{VF}\">\\(\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{VF}\\)</span> 为已展开的标准系统。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SentDisq},\\mathsf{TermUniformDisq},\\mathsf{SKCompInd},\\mathsf{CompCapRel},\\mathsf{Supervaluation}\">\\(\\mathsf{SentDisq},\\mathsf{TermUniformDisq},\\mathsf{SKCompInd},\\mathsf{CompCapRel},\\mathsf{Supervaluation}\\)</span> 是记录标签，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Core}\">\\(\\operatorname{Core}\\)</span> 为下述有限映射。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}overview}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Core}\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathrm{TB},\\mathsf{SentDisq}),(\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathsf{TermUniformDisq}),\n(\\mathrm{KF},\\mathsf{SKCompInd}),(\\mathrm{FS},\\mathsf{CompCapRel}),(\\mathrm{VF},\\mathsf{Supervaluation})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}overview}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Core}\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathrm{TB},\\mathsf{SentDisq}),(\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathsf{TermUniformDisq}),\n(\\mathrm{KF},\\mathsf{SKCompInd}),(\\mathrm{FS},\\mathsf{CompCapRel}),(\\mathrm{VF},\\mathsf{Supervaluation})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>映射记录公理机制而非一个未经定义的强度函数。五者都使用完整归纳的原书版本；TB 与 UTB 的保守性说明“有真理语言归纳”本身不是非保守性的充分条件。\nKF 是强 Kleene 公理的经典理论，FS 的捕获/释放作用于无假设的已证句，VF 公理化超赋值。使用同一个原始符号 T 不使它们有相同算术后果。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 7.1–7.2、14.1/14.4、15.2；第 18 章。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-TB","status":"resolved","id":"6018cc1b13710826","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-TB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-UTB","status":"resolved","id":"2f215d3f10d33ae6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-UTB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-KF","status":"resolved","id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-KF]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-FS","status":"resolved","id":"25c37fe51095276d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-FS]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-VF","status":"resolved","id":"669ee474b9646a38","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-VF]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{VF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{SentDisq},\\mathsf{TermUniformDisq},\\mathsf{SKCompInd},\\mathsf{CompCapRel},\\mathsf{Supervaluation}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Core}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}overview}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Core}\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathrm{TB},\\mathsf{SentDisq}),(\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathsf{TermUniformDisq}),\n(\\mathrm{KF},\\mathsf{SKCompInd}),(\\mathrm{FS},\\mathsf{CompCapRel}),(\\mathrm{VF},\\mathsf{Supervaluation})\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1534,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-212","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-fact-truth-theory-overview]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-212","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-fact-truth-theory-overview]]"}],"outgoing":["6018cc1b13710826","2f215d3f10d33ae6","a0a2284f96eaea1d","25c37fe51095276d","669ee474b9646a38"]}